        <link href="https://www.stream.security/post/cloud-identity-network-segmentation-shrinking-the-breach-blast-radius"/>
        <updated>2025-10-06T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<a id="w-node-f89a47ce-8c27-a5bd-21a6-455c8d4992a9-83c22ebb" data-wf-native-id-path="f89a47ce-8c27-a5bd-21a6-455c8d4992a9_instance-3" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="f89a47ce-8c27-a5bd-21a6-455c8d4992a9" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2265dbcab8c88303f083c22dc7%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%2268d0f6b71fea0931a7e17f0d%22%7D%5D" href="/post/cloud-identity-network-segmentation-shrinking-the-breach-blast-radius" class="w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68e38008181117c81c86aa7c_blast%20blog%20-%20cover.png" loading="lazy" alt="Cloud Identity &amp; Network Segmentation: Shrinking the Breach Blast Radius" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, (max-width: 767px) 96vw, (max-width: 991px) 46vw, (max-width: 1439px) 30vw, 416px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68e38008181117c81c86aa7c_blast%20blog%20-%20cover-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68e38008181117c81c86aa7c_blast%20blog%20-%20cover-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68e38008181117c81c86aa7c_blast%20blog%20-%20cover-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68e38008181117c81c86aa7c_blast%20blog%20-%20cover.png 1200w" class="post-image"></a><div class="post-content-div"><div class="div-block-992"><div class="blog-category">Cloud Detection &amp; Response </div><a data-wf-native-id-path="f89a47ce-8c27-a5bd-21a6-455c8d4992ae_instance-3" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="f89a47ce-8c27-a5bd-21a6-455c8d4992ae" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2265dbcab8c88303f083c22dc7%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%2268d0f6b71fea0931a7e17f0d%22%7D%5D" href="/post/cloud-identity-network-segmentation-shrinking-the-breach-blast-radius" class="b-title w-inline-block"><h5 class="heading-29 blog">Cloud Identity &amp; Network Segmentation: Shrinking the Breach Blast Radius</h5><div class="blog-par limit-char">When we talk about cloud hardening, encryption, patching, and zero-day detection usually get all the spotlight. But in reality, the single most important factor in reducing breach impact is blast radius reduction. That comes down to two things: identity segmentation and network segmentation.</div></a></div><div class="divider-full space small"></div><div class="div-block-773"><div class="writer-small dark"><img height="70" width="70" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/67fd41b21a87a398c1aa86dd_STAV.webp" class="writer-image-small"><div><div class="writer---blog-page-home">Stav Sitnikov</div></div></div><div class="div-block-790 xs"><div class="div-block-953"><div class="writer---blog-page-home date">Oct 6, 2025</div></div><div class="code-embed-3 w-embed"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
