        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<a id="w-node-f89a47ce-8c27-a5bd-21a6-455c8d4992a9-83c22ebb" data-wf-native-id-path="f89a47ce-8c27-a5bd-21a6-455c8d4992a9_instance-4" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="f89a47ce-8c27-a5bd-21a6-455c8d4992a9" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2265dbcab8c88303f083c22dc7%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%2268da80c5e9ce86878410ed55%22%7D%5D" href="/post/cdrgoat-scenario-2-web-vuln-to-full-account-takeover-via-ssm-iam" class="w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68da7efe1315bd57794dea59_goat%202%20blog%20-%20cover%20(1).png" loading="lazy" alt="CDRGoat Scenario 2: Web Vuln to Full Account Takeover via SSM &amp; IAM   " sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, (max-width: 767px) 96vw, (max-width: 991px) 46vw, (max-width: 1439px) 30vw, 416px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68da7efe1315bd57794dea59_goat%202%20blog%20-%20cover%20(1)-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68da7efe1315bd57794dea59_goat%202%20blog%20-%20cover%20(1)-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68da7efe1315bd57794dea59_goat%202%20blog%20-%20cover%20(1)-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68da7efe1315bd57794dea59_goat%202%20blog%20-%20cover%20(1).png 1200w" class="post-image"></a><div class="post-content-div"><div class="div-block-992"><div class="blog-category">Cloud Detection &amp; Response </div><a data-wf-native-id-path="f89a47ce-8c27-a5bd-21a6-455c8d4992ae_instance-4" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="f89a47ce-8c27-a5bd-21a6-455c8d4992ae" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2265dbcab8c88303f083c22dc7%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%2268da80c5e9ce86878410ed55%22%7D%5D" href="/post/cdrgoat-scenario-2-web-vuln-to-full-account-takeover-via-ssm-iam" class="b-title w-inline-block"><h5 class="heading-29 blog">CDRGoat Scenario 2: Web Vuln to Full Account Takeover via SSM &amp; IAM   </h5><div class="blog-par limit-char">Let’s dive in to our first attack scenario together: CDRGoat Scenario 2. This scenario demonstrates how a simple but popular web application vulnerability, SSRF, can escalate into complete AWS account compromise. We'll walk through a realistic attack chain that leverages common cloud misconfigurations rather than obvious security flaws.</div></a></div><div class="divider-full space small"></div><div class="div-block-773"><div class="writer-small dark"><img height="70" width="70" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23).png" sizes="(max-width: 991px) 24px, (max-width: 1439px) 2vw, (max-width: 1919px) 24px, 1vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23)-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23)-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23)-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23).png 1400w" class="writer-image-small"><div><div class="writer---blog-page-home">Petr Zuzanov</div></div></div><div class="div-block-790 xs"><div class="div-block-953"><div class="writer---blog-page-home date">Sep 29, 2025</div></div><div class="code-embed-3 w-embed"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
