        <updated>2025-09-17T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<a id="w-node-f89a47ce-8c27-a5bd-21a6-455c8d4992a9-83c22ebb" data-wf-native-id-path="f89a47ce-8c27-a5bd-21a6-455c8d4992a9_instance-6" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="f89a47ce-8c27-a5bd-21a6-455c8d4992a9" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2265dbcab8c88303f083c22dc7%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%2268c97857181266c0e7fd0f5a%22%7D%5D" href="/post/stream-cdrgoat-real-world-attack-simulations-for-threat-detection-readiness" class="w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68c97330c29fd17778add91a_goat%20blog%20-%20cover.png" loading="lazy" alt="Stream CDRGoat: Real World Attack Simulations for Threat Detection Readiness" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, (max-width: 767px) 96vw, (max-width: 991px) 46vw, (max-width: 1439px) 30vw, 416px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68c97330c29fd17778add91a_goat%20blog%20-%20cover-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68c97330c29fd17778add91a_goat%20blog%20-%20cover-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68c97330c29fd17778add91a_goat%20blog%20-%20cover-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68c97330c29fd17778add91a_goat%20blog%20-%20cover.png 1200w" class="post-image"></a><div class="post-content-div"><div class="div-block-992"><div class="blog-category">Cloud Detection &amp; Response </div><a data-wf-native-id-path="f89a47ce-8c27-a5bd-21a6-455c8d4992ae_instance-6" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="f89a47ce-8c27-a5bd-21a6-455c8d4992ae" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2265dbcab8c88303f083c22dc7%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%2268c97857181266c0e7fd0f5a%22%7D%5D" href="/post/stream-cdrgoat-real-world-attack-simulations-for-threat-detection-readiness" class="b-title w-inline-block"><h5 class="heading-29 blog">Stream CDRGoat: Real World Attack Simulations for Threat Detection Readiness</h5><div class="blog-par limit-char">Stream's CDRGoat is an open-source project that lets SecOps teams safely validate detections and investigations against realistic cloud attack paths. Each scenario, developed by Stream’s Security Research and Product teams, includes vulnerable infrastructure and walks through a guided live attack to show exactly how adversaries exploit cloud environments in practice.</div></a></div><div class="divider-full space small"></div><div class="div-block-773"><div class="writer-small dark"><img height="70" width="70" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23).png" sizes="(max-width: 991px) 24px, (max-width: 1439px) 2vw, (max-width: 1919px) 24px, 1vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23)-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23)-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23)-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23).png 1400w" class="writer-image-small"><div><div class="writer---blog-page-home">Petr Zuzanov</div></div></div><div class="div-block-790 xs"><div class="div-block-953"><div class="writer---blog-page-home date">Sep 17, 2025</div></div><div class="code-embed-3 w-embed"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
