        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Cloud Moved Fast. Detection & Triage Didn’t. (Real-World Example Included)]]></title>
        <id>https://www.stream.security/post/the-secops-reality-detection-triage-is-broken-when-it-comes-to-cloud</id>
        <link href="https://www.stream.security/post/the-secops-reality-detection-triage-is-broken-when-it-comes-to-cloud"/>
        <updated>2025-09-03T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<a id="w-node-f89a47ce-8c27-a5bd-21a6-455c8d4992a9-83c22ebb" data-wf-native-id-path="f89a47ce-8c27-a5bd-21a6-455c8d4992a9_instance-7" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="f89a47ce-8c27-a5bd-21a6-455c8d4992a9" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2265dbcab8c88303f083c22dc7%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%2268b85c7368ec1098d9a38be3%22%7D%5D" href="/post/the-secops-reality-detection-triage-is-broken-when-it-comes-to-cloud" class="w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68b85b2e2b7b340ae2335668_The%20SecOps%20Reality%20(1).png" loading="lazy" alt="Cloud Moved Fast. Detection &amp; Triage Didn’t. (Real-World Example Included)" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, (max-width: 767px) 96vw, (max-width: 991px) 46vw, (max-width: 1439px) 30vw, 416px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68b85b2e2b7b340ae2335668_The%20SecOps%20Reality%20(1)-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68b85b2e2b7b340ae2335668_The%20SecOps%20Reality%20(1)-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68b85b2e2b7b340ae2335668_The%20SecOps%20Reality%20(1)-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68b85b2e2b7b340ae2335668_The%20SecOps%20Reality%20(1).png 1200w" class="post-image"></a><div class="post-content-div"><div class="div-block-992"><div class="blog-category">Cloud Detection &amp; Response </div><a data-wf-native-id-path="f89a47ce-8c27-a5bd-21a6-455c8d4992ae_instance-7" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="f89a47ce-8c27-a5bd-21a6-455c8d4992ae" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2265dbcab8c88303f083c22dc7%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%2268b85c7368ec1098d9a38be3%22%7D%5D" href="/post/the-secops-reality-detection-triage-is-broken-when-it-comes-to-cloud" class="b-title w-inline-block"><h5 class="heading-29 blog">Cloud Moved Fast. Detection &amp; Triage Didn’t. (Real-World Example Included)</h5><div class="blog-par limit-char">For large-scale cloud environments, the math is simple. When detections depend on stale data, triage is manual, and investigations are fragmented, even the best teams fall behind. Stream’s platform gives SecOps teams complete cloud visibility in real-time, with built-in automations and AI tooling that make investigations easy. </div></a></div><div class="divider-full space small"></div><div class="div-block-773"><div class="writer-small dark"><img height="70" width="70" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23).png" sizes="(max-width: 991px) 24px, (max-width: 1439px) 2vw, (max-width: 1919px) 24px, 1vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23)-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23)-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23)-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68adfa06ebf00dbc01e2501c_image%20(23).png 1400w" class="writer-image-small"><div><div class="writer---blog-page-home">Petr Zuzanov</div></div></div><div class="div-block-790 xs"><div class="div-block-953"><div class="writer---blog-page-home date">Sep 3, 2025</div></div><div class="code-embed-3 w-embed"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
